{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sous Raccoon</strong>\u00a0is an Action-Roguelike Defense game where you embark on a journey to open restaurants in various locations with the head chef, where you\u2019ll spend 7 days at each location before moving on to the next</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/499bbcce279c048304172dd5d4866883.poster.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/499bbcce279c048304172dd5d4866883.webm?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/499bbcce279c048304172dd5d4866883.mp4?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Elmo</strong>, the raccoon sous chef you\u2019ll be playing as, your duties include handling <strong>EVERYTHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/3e1cbac8e966e360c94bb941ef1ab575.poster.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/3e1cbac8e966e360c94bb941ef1ab575.webm?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/3e1cbac8e966e360c94bb941ef1ab575.mp4?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be taking the meaning of <strong>\u201cto serve and protect\u201d</strong> to another level as you do the following:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take and deliver orders, gather ingredients for the chef, serve the food, protect customers from attacking monsters, and dance to entertain and heal customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/6d0942ccf362fea7a7dc8137c36e610f.poster.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/6d0942ccf362fea7a7dc8137c36e610f.webm?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/6d0942ccf362fea7a7dc8137c36e610f.mp4?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spot a bird, knock the coins out of them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins can be used to <strong>purchase random offerings of skills from the merchant each day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chef\u2019s Mood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chef is going through the motions everyday</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/ca60075a8d16becc4fc1c45350c16d6a.poster.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/ca60075a8d16becc4fc1c45350c16d6a.webm?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/ca60075a8d16becc4fc1c45350c16d6a.mp4?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a chance for special events to occur that will either <strong>increase or decrease the difficulty of your gameplay experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Get Fired</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chef will fire you</strong> if you make him mad so try not to lose too many customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/39438e6ed007d97d89553e6effd1b258.poster.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/39438e6ed007d97d89553e6effd1b258.webm?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/39438e6ed007d97d89553e6effd1b258.mp4?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wellcome to Raccoon City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/6c2e02c0958dc6f67fc316f00d48fca01cbea847.jpg"},{"name":"Sea Salt Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/b98344566316f9a42cf58518684dd75f255b87c0.jpg"},{"name":"Coastal King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/b839d899067143ac2386dcd01a09ce688bab7570.jpg"},{"name":"Jungle Gourmet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/365dfff90100818f494146c8867eeadc63b4baf5.jpg"},{"name":"Make Chef Dreams Come True","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/e4b478206336e5334169d0af1ecf077948cb540c.jpg"},{"name":"Sleep Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/1b38322e948f26e24ddcfcd856fb134d1c301236.jpg"},{"name":"I'm The Perfect Raccoon.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/ed768ea61eaf396043f6a480cf0cd7c0437b3a83.jpg"},{"name":"What do you expect from this?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/4cce457fb4916e052bd31fb35c1dff3cbc23a76b.jpg"},{"name":"Henry is the best!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/fb938542daec52ab603a2e2472b40656912e31c5.jpg"},{"name":"Mommy, I love you.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/cd64ec4661da1ec4acb8f9e4fc1ba74c284af5b4.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919140?t=1774007861","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/35c8bde2841ad43715d481710472ea4edba76073/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774007861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/bfe4cadbd75792aef371cd147bbf4ce0fad663ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774007861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/bfe4cadbd75792aef371cd147bbf4ce0fad663ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774007861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/52d054ee0518091d85b6895a55509913.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our roadmap going from the start of development, all the way to the full release of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be adding <strong>new bosses, new monsters, and new perks</strong> for each stage we hit</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sous Raccoon</strong>\u00a0is an Action-Roguelike Defense game where you embark on a journey to open restaurants in various locations with the head chef, where you\u2019ll spend 7 days at each location before moving on to the next</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/499bbcce279c048304172dd5d4866883.poster.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/499bbcce279c048304172dd5d4866883.webm?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/499bbcce279c048304172dd5d4866883.mp4?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Elmo</strong>, the raccoon sous chef you\u2019ll be playing as, your duties include handling <strong>EVERYTHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/3e1cbac8e966e360c94bb941ef1ab575.poster.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/3e1cbac8e966e360c94bb941ef1ab575.webm?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/3e1cbac8e966e360c94bb941ef1ab575.mp4?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be taking the meaning of <strong>\u201cto serve and protect\u201d</strong> to another level as you do the following:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take and deliver orders, gather ingredients for the chef, serve the food, protect customers from attacking monsters, and dance to entertain and heal customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/6d0942ccf362fea7a7dc8137c36e610f.poster.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/6d0942ccf362fea7a7dc8137c36e610f.webm?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/6d0942ccf362fea7a7dc8137c36e610f.mp4?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spot a bird, knock the coins out of them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins can be used to <strong>purchase random offerings of skills from the merchant each day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chef\u2019s Mood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chef is going through the motions everyday</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/ca60075a8d16becc4fc1c45350c16d6a.poster.avif?t=1774007861\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/ca60075a8d16becc4fc1c45350c16d6a.webm?t=1774007861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/ca60075a8d16be